{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZEdge"],"declarations":27,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.pentagon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.pentagon","kind":"theorem","line":351,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L351-L398","doc":"**The pentagon for the KZ associator.** For four-point residues satisfying the infinitesimal\nbraid relations, with the five boundary residues non-resonant, the KZ associators of the five\nboundary divisors of `M̄_{0,5}` multiply to `1`:\n`Φ(T₂₃₄, t₁₂) Φ(t₂₃, t₃₄) Φ(T₁₂₃, T₂₃₄) Φ(t₁₂, t₂₃) Φ(t₃₄, T₁₂₃) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner51","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner51","kind":"theorem","line":339,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L339-L345","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner45","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner45","kind":"theorem","line":330,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L330-L336","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner34","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner34","kind":"theorem","line":325,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L325-L327","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner23","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner23","kind":"theorem","line":317,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L317-L322","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner12","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner12","kind":"theorem","line":308,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L308-L314","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.W_corner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.W_corner","kind":"theorem","line":302,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L302-L305","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner_step","kind":"theorem","line":255,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L255-L293","doc":"**One corner of the pentagon.** The previous chart has `ε`-residue `X` and `s`-residue `Y`\nat `1`; the next has `ε`-residue `Y` and `s`-residue `X` at `0`; the two charts agree at the\ncorner, `ψ'(1−β, α) = ψ(α(1−β)/(1−αβ), β)`. Then the previous chart's `b` equals the next\nchart's `a`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.edge_assoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.edge_assoc","kind":"theorem","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L215-L251","doc":"**The edge theorem with the three-point normalisations.** For an edge chart and a reference\nsolution `N` on `Δ`, there are constants `a` (a unit) and `b` with `a = b Φ_KZ(P, Q)`,\n`N a = F G₀` and `N b = F G₁` along the edge. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.Φ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.Φ","kind":"def","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L208-L211","doc":"The KZ associator `Φ_KZ(P, Q)` built from the normalised formal solutions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.commute_H0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.commute_H0","kind":"theorem","line":201,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L201-L206","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.boundedOn_H0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.boundedOn_H0","kind":"theorem","line":197,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L197-L198","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.H0_gauge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.H0_gauge","kind":"theorem","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L193-L194","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.H0_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.H0_zero","kind":"theorem","line":190,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L190-L190","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.H0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.H0","kind":"def","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L186-L187","doc":"The normalised formal solution of the three-point KZ system at `0` (residues `P, Q`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner_glue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.corner_glue","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L87-L182","doc":"**Gluing at a corner.** The previous chart has `ε`-residue `X` and the next `ε`-residue `Y`,\nwith `X` the next chart's `s`-residue at `0` and `Y` the previous chart's `s`-residue at `1`.\nIf along the corner the reference `N` satisfies `N b = F' G₁'` and `N a = F G₀` (with the\nthree-point series `H₁` of the previous chart and `H₀` of the next), then `b = a`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.wc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.wc","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L84-L85","doc":"The factor `w = (1−β)/(1−αβ)`, so that `σ = α w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.σc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.σc","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L81-L82","doc":"The chart-`i` edge coordinate `s = α(1−β)/(1−αβ)` of the corner point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.zero_mem_U","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.zero_mem_U","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L77-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.analyticAt_H_s","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.analyticAt_H_s","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L72-L75","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.analyticAt_H_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.analyticAt_H_e","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L68-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.H_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.H_zero","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L65-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.cpowA_mul_ofReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.cpowA_mul_ofReal","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L56-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.cpowA_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.cpowA_one","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.analyticAt_cpowA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.analyticAt_cpowA","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L47-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.analyticAt_cseries","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.analyticAt_cseries","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L41-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.commute_cseries","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.KZPentagon.commute_cseries","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/KZPentagon.lean#L31-L39","signatureChunk":0}]}